>>
Rule 1 (input tensor dtype must not be boolean)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor dtype must be a numeric tensor type)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10
>>
Rule 3 (supports any tensor dimensionality, including scalars)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (zero-sized dimensions are allowed)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then true else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
